{\b\fs28 IN THE SUPERIOR COURT OF THE STATE OF EXAMPLE}\par
{\b\fs28 COUNTY OF SAMPLE}\par
ACME HOLDINGS, LLC, Plaintiff, v. EXAMPLE CORP., Defendant. Case No. 00-CV-0000\par
{\b STIPULATION FOR REFERRAL TO MEDIATION}\par
The parties, by their undersigned counsel, stipulate as follows:\par
1. The parties agree to the referral of this action to mediation before a mutually acceptable mediator.\par
2. Mediation shall be completed within ninety (90) days of the date of this stipulation.\par
3. The costs of mediation shall be shared equally between Acme Holdings, LLC and Example Corp.\par
4. All discovery deadlines are stayed pending the outcome of the referral.\par
